Origin of the files in this directory
=====================================

Every file beside this one is a byte-for-byte copy of Frigate's own nginx
configuration at the revision the deployment runs. They are vendored, never
edited: the harness applies ../offline.patch to a scratch copy at run time, so
a reviewer can diff these files against upstream and get an empty result.

